LABEL live
TEXT HELP
Start @DISTRO_NAME@ from this medium to try it or install it.
ENDTEXT
MENU LABEL @DISTRO_PRETTY_NAME@ live (BIOS)
LINUX /%INSTALL_DIR%/boot/%ARCH%/vmlinuz-linux
INITRD /%INSTALL_DIR%/boot/%ARCH%/initramfs-linux.img
APPEND archisobasedir=%INSTALL_DIR% archisosearchuuid=%ARCHISO_UUID% quiet loglevel=3 rd.udev.log_level=3 cow_spacesize=4G

LABEL safe
TEXT HELP
Use the firmware's basic display driver. Choose this if the screen stays
black or the graphical session does not start.
ENDTEXT
MENU LABEL @DISTRO_PRETTY_NAME@ live, ^safe graphics (BIOS)
LINUX /%INSTALL_DIR%/boot/%ARCH%/vmlinuz-linux
INITRD /%INSTALL_DIR%/boot/%ARCH%/initramfs-linux.img
APPEND archisobasedir=%INSTALL_DIR% archisosearchuuid=%ARCHISO_UUID% nomodeset @DISTRO_ID@.safe_graphics=1 cow_spacesize=4G

LABEL copytoram
TEXT HELP
Load the whole live system into memory (needs 8 GB of RAM or more); the
USB stick can be removed once it has started.
ENDTEXT
MENU LABEL @DISTRO_PRETTY_NAME@ live, copied to ^RAM (BIOS)
LINUX /%INSTALL_DIR%/boot/%ARCH%/vmlinuz-linux
INITRD /%INSTALL_DIR%/boot/%ARCH%/initramfs-linux.img
APPEND archisobasedir=%INSTALL_DIR% archisosearchuuid=%ARCHISO_UUID% quiet loglevel=3 copytoram=y cow_spacesize=4G
